        "tab_2_label": "The Science",
        "tab_2_source": "custom",
        "tab_2_content": "<p>NAD+ is the molecule every cell needs to produce energy. Levels fall by around half between the ages of 40 and 60.</p><p>NEU+ delivers 300mg of Nicotinamide Riboside (NR), a clinically studied NAD+ precursor, supported by TMG for methylation and Vitamin C for immune support. Together they restore the cofactors your body needs daily.</p>",
        "tab_3_label": "Ingredients",
        "tab_3_source": "custom",
        "tab_3_content": "<h3>What's in every shot</h3><p><strong>Nicotinamide Riboside (300mg)</strong> — NAD+ precursor. Supports cellular energy, focus and recovery.</p><p><strong>Betaine / TMG (250mg)</strong> — Supports methylation and optimal cellular function.</p><p><strong>Vitamin C (80mg)</strong> — Supports immunity, reduces tiredness and supports collagen.</p><h3>Usage & instructions</h3><p>Recommended daily dose: 1 x 60ml shot per day. Best time to take: AM.</p><h3>Storage</h3><p>Store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight, refrigerate after opening and consume within two days. Shelf life (unopened): per date on bottle lid.</p><h3>Warnings / disclaimers</h3><p>Not recommend for individuals under 18 years of age, or those who are pregnant, breast feeding, or trying to conceive. If you’re taking any medication or have a medical condition, please consult a healthcare professional before use. Keep out of sight and reach of children. Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a varied and balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle.</p>",
        "show_sticky_bar": true,
        "sticky_button_label": "Add to cart"
      }
